    description: Some("Clear each maze of pellets while the ghosts hunt you, and swallow an energizer to turn the tables and eat them for points. Four mazes alternate as you progress, the ghosts move semi-randomly so no memorised route will save you, and the fruit bounces through the maze and out of the warp tunnels rather than sitting still."),
